    { "name": "http:POST:/users", "kind": "http_endpoint_call", "source_file": "Sources/App/UserService.swift", "must_exist": true, "note": "createUser sets httpMethod=\"POST\" on a request to baseURL.appendingPathComponent(\"users\"). Emitted as `http:POST:/` — the `http:<METHOD>:<path>` shape is the extractor's own, and the path segment is stated literally in the source, so the correct name is derived rather than invented. Wrong path, gated as a miss, for the same reason `Post` in groovy-grails-mini is gated on its wrong kind." }
  ],
